,"mother":"Asenath","v":[1,16,18]},{"id":"israel_682","name":"Israel","also":"","summary":"One who follows on another’s heels; supplanter, (Gen. 25:26; 27:36; Hos. 12:2-4), the second born of the twin sons of Isaac by Rebekah. He was born probably at Lahai-roi, when his father was fifty-nine and Abraham one hundred and fifty-nine years old.","verses":1009,"father":"Isaac","mother":"Rebekah","v":[12,30]},{"id":"benjamin_463","name":"Benjamin","also":"Ben-oni","summary":"The younger son of Jacob by Rachel (Gen. 35:18). His birth took place at Ephrath, on the road between Bethel and Bethlehem, at a short distance from the latter place.","verses":157,"father":"Israel","mother":"Rachel","v":[14]}],"places":[{"id":"jebus_629","name":"Jebus","kind":"City","lat":31.77744,"lon":35.23494,"summary":"Trodden hard, or fastness, or “the waterless hill”, the name of the Canaanitish city which stood on Mount Zion (Josh. 15:8; 18:16, 28). It is identified with Jerusalem in Judg. 19:10, and with the castle or city of David (1 Chr. 11:4, 5).","verses":5,"v":[10,11]},{"id":"jerusalem_636","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"City","lat":31.77667,"lon":35.23417,"summary":"Called also Salem, Ariel, Jebus, the “city of God,” the “holy city;” by the modern Arabs el-Khuds, meaning “the holy;” once “the city of Judah” (2 Chr. 25:28).","verses":754,"v":[10]},{"id":"gibeah_466","name":"Gibeah","kind":"","lat":31.82378,"lon":35.23101,"summary":"A hill or hill-town, “of Benjamin” (1 Sam. 13:15), better known as “Gibeah of Saul” (11:4; Isa. 10:29). It was here that the terrible outrage was committed on the Levite’s concubine which led to the almost utter extirpation of the tribe of Benjamin (Judg. 19; 20), only six hundred men surviving after a succession of disastrous battles.","verses":41,"v":[12,13,14,15,16]},{"id":"ramah_972","name":"Ramah","kind":"City","lat":31.89964,"lon":35.20422,"summary":"A city first mentioned in Josh. 18:25, near Gibeah of Benjamin. It was fortified by Baasha, king of Israel (1 Kings 15:17-22; 2 Chr. 16:1-6).","verses":17,"v":[13]},{"id":"egypt_362","name":"Egypt","kind":"Region (Country)","lat":26.4902,"lon":29.8808,"summary":"The land of the Nile and the pyramids, the oldest kingdom of which we have any record, holds a place of great significance in Scripture.","verses":564,"v":[30]}],"events":[],"traditions":[],"sources":["JFB","MHCC"],"tags":{"bsb":[[1961,1992,1992,3117,369,369,369,369,4428,3478,3478,3881,3881,1481,1481,3411,3411,3411,2022,2022,669,669,3947,0,0,6370,6370,1035,1035,3063,3063],[6370,6370,2181,2181,5921,5921,1980,1980,854,413,413,413,1,1,1004,413,1035,3063,3063,1961,1961,1961,1961,8033,702,2320],[376,376,6965,6965,1980,1980,310,310,1696,1696,3820,5921,5921,7725,7725,7725,7725,5288,5288,5288,6776,6776,6776,2543,2543,935,935,935,935,935,1,1,1,1004,5291,5291,5291,1,7200,7200,8055,8055,7122,7122],[2859,2859,5291,5291,1,2388,2388,2388,2388,3427,3427,3427,854,854,7969,3117,398,8354,3885,3885,8033],[7243,7243,7243,3117,7925,7925,7925,7925,1242,1242,1242,6965,6965,1980,1980,5291,5291,5291,1,559,413,2860,2860,5582,3820,3820,6595,6595,6595,3899,3899,310,310,1980,1980,1980],[3427,3427,3427,3427,8147,8147,8147,398,398,398,8354,8354,3162,5291,5291,5291,1,559,413,376,376,4994,2974,3885,3885,3885,3820,3820,3820,3820,3190,3190],[376,376,6965,6965,1980,1980,2859,2859,2859,6484,0,3885,3885,3885,8033,8033,8033],[2549,2549,2549,3117,7925,7925,7925,7925,1242,1242,1242,1980,1980,5291,5291,5291,1,559,4994,5582,3824,3824,4102,4102,4102,5704,5186,5186,8147,8147,8147,398,398,398],[376,376,376,6965,6965,1980,1980,6370,6370,6370,5288,5288,5288,2859,2859,5291,5291,1,559,0,0,2009,3117,3117,7503,7503,6150,6150,6150,4994,3885,3885,3885,2009,3117,3117,2583,2583,2583,3885,3885,3885,6311,3824,3824,3824,3190,3190,3190,7925,7925,7925,7925,7925,7925,4279,1870,1870,1870,168],[376,376,376,3808,3808,3885,3885,3885,3885,6965,6965,6965,1980,1980,935,935,5227,2982,1931,1931,3389,5973,6776,6776,2280,2543,6370,6370,6370],[1992,1992,5973,5973,2982,3117,3117,3117,3966